# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Layer-1 curated data, part B: the reaction / experiment warehouse.

Record = (id, NAME, category, reactants, products, observations, extras)

observations is a ';'-separated list of coded cues the engine renders:
  p:colour[+descriptor]  precipitate forms        e.g. p:white-curdy
  g:gasname              gas evolves              g:co2  g:o2  g:h2  g:cl2  g:so2  g:nh3  g:no2  g:ch4
  c:from->to             solution colour changes  c:blue->colourless
  h:hot|warm|cold|ice-cold                       thermal feel of the vessel
  f:flame                flame colour / light
  s:smell-name           odour
  l:pop|light|glow|smoke|fizz|fog|gel|crystal|deposit   physical sound/other
  t:SECONDS|minutes|hours   typical timescale
  n:text                 a plain note the UI can show verbatim

extras is ';'-separated key=value: T= C= dH= Ea= danger= time= app= scale= tag= yield= ref=
Every equation below is atom-and-charge checked by scripts/build_warehouse.py using
lib/chem.py, so a typo becomes a build failure rather than a wrong experiment.
"""

